# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Synced from CYLTabBarController's .gitignore
# (https://github.com/ChenYilong/CYLTabBarController/blob/master/.gitignore), with its project name replaced by
# CYLTableViewPlaceHolder. Rules already listed above are repeated where CYLTabBarController lists them, so the two files
# can be compared section by section. Paths that exist only in CYLTabBarController (Example-Shared/PAGResources,
# Example-SwiftUI-Rive, Example-loadTabBarIconsFroNework) are left out. Re-check before every commit (instructions.md).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
